      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "2. Considering the materials available in the case diary and the statement of the complainant as reveled form the FIR read with the statements of the independent witnesses and also considering the medical report which corroborates the statements of the complainant and others, we are not inclined to grant anticipatory bail to the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 704,
